# venv
.venv/
# === Data gateway directories (import/export staging) ===
# These carry files moving in/out via gateways and can hold sensitive
# content (screenshots, statements, exports) - never commit them.
# Root-anchored on purpose: a nested src/.../export/ is source code
# (e.g. an API route), not a staging area, and must stay tracked.
/import/
/imports/
/export/
/exports/